      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if the dark is the only place where he actually is? i keep dreaming about him, and in those dreams, the pain is gone. it's like i'm just stuck in this gray world while he's somewhere peaceful. sometimes i think it would be easier to just be where he is instead of being stuck here alone.",
